visited the railway heritage museum (Golra Sharif) with Zara on saturday
- old steam engines, a saloon car used by the viceroy
- the signalman showed us the semaphore signals: the arm goes down for "proceed" and horizontal for "stop", worked by levers and long wires from the cabin
- zara loved the hand-cranked trolley
- tickets PKR 200, closes at 4 pm
- the little cafe on the platform does good pakoras
